# UI design system — Ocean palette

Use the **Ocean** theme: classic corporate blue + sky accent. Tokens live in `src/app/globals.css` — never hardcode `blue-*` / `slate-*` for app chrome.

## Semantic tokens (Tailwind)

| Token | Use |
|-------|-----|
| `bg-background` | Page canvas |
| `bg-surface` | Cards, nav, inputs |
| `text-foreground` | Headings, primary body |
| `text-muted` | Descriptions, meta |
| `text-brand` | Logo / app name in nav |
| `text-accent` | Links, secondary actions |
| `border-border` | All borders |
| `bg-primary` / `text-primary-foreground` | Primary buttons |
| `hover:bg-primary-hover` | Primary button hover |
| `bg-accent-soft` / `text-accent-soft-foreground` | Badges, soft highlights |

## Layout

- Page content: `max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-10` (already on `<main>`)
- Section spacing: `flex flex-col gap-8` between major blocks
- Page header: `.page-title` + `.page-lead` (or equivalent utilities)
- Lists: `.list-row` for clickable rows; `.action-card` for marketplace grid items
- Grids: `grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3` for action cards

## Components (prefer shared classes from globals.css)

- Primary CTA: `.btn-primary`
- Secondary / outline: `.btn-secondary`
- Text inputs: `.input-field`
- Links: `.link-accent`
- Panels: `.surface-card` with `p-6`

## Typography

- Font: Geist Sans (already loaded)
- Page title: `text-3xl font-semibold`
- Section title: `text-lg font-semibold`
- Body: default; muted copy uses `text-muted`
- RTL (Hebrew): rely on existing `dir` on `<html>` — do not override text alignment unless needed

## Do / don't

- ✅ `border-border`, `text-accent`, `bg-surface`, shared component classes
- ✅ Keep dark mode automatic via CSS variables (no duplicate `dark:` color pairs unless for one-off cases)
- ❌ Raw `text-blue-900`, `border-blue-100`, `bg-blue-50`, etc.
- ❌ Inline hex colors in TSX

## Ocean hex reference

Light: bg `#eef4fb`, surface `#ffffff`, text `#0c1929`, primary `#1d4ed8`, accent `#0284c7`  
Dark: bg `#0c1929`, surface `#132337`, text `#f0f9ff`, primary `#0284c7`, accent `#38bdf8`
